# the USV_Detections deletion incident (commit 78d1c70). See CLAUDE.md "Git Data Safety".
/USV_lab_131204/
/USV_lab_131204_chunked_2s_full/
/USV_lab_131204_chunked_2s_hot/
/USV_lab_131204_chunked_2s_test/
