/classified_detections_lab_131204*.csv

# Git worktrees live INSIDE the repo dir but must NEVER be tracked by the parent repo.
# `.claude/worktrees/goofy-elbakyan` leaked in as a committed gitlink (commit 5993c5e3);
# untracked via `git rm --cached` and ignored here on 2026-05-26.
.claude/worktrees/
.claire/worktrees/

# Security — rig SSH-coordinate leakage protection (added 2026-05-20 after audit).
# These paths contain plaintext Tailscale IP / SSH-user / hostname for the rig.
# To version-control any of them: sanitize first (replace literals with <RIG_*>
# placeholders), then `git add` by exact path.
/handoff_to_rig/
/docs/handoffs/*rig*.md
/docs/handoffs/2026-05-10_lab-finetune-experiment-matrix*.md

